request 例(example) v1 "例"

use calendar 事務所(office) from "shared/事務所.cal"
use calendar 工場(plant) from "shared/工場.cal"

form
  金額(amount) : money[円] "金額"  range >=1円 <=100_000円

route
  確かめ(check)  経理

who
  経理(finance) = team finance

every stage
  due in 2 business days in 事務所 at end of day
  remind after 2 business days in 工場 at 09:00

ticket
  self approval  not allowed

claims
  期限の前に催促する : every stage reminds before it is due
